  "details": "just a simple request you guys can do anyone can do this. adding a lock icon that would pause joins from that instance. this would help prevent crasher raids and much more. \n\nyou know this would work against those who send so many accounts into a instance only for the udon not to be able to keep up and then boom crashes the instance.\n\nit would immediately stop the joining of users for a split second like if any accounts make it it would would say instance had been locked and it would remove them to the loading screen until they press go home or the lobby has unlocked.\n\nalso i noticed some clients back in the day when i was watching youtube had this feature called lock instance. this is where i got that idea from. >: ) \n\nthis would be a massive win against photon clients that spam accounts into the instance.",
